@node CxR Library
@appendixsec CxR Library

The @code{(scheme cxr)} library exports twenty-four procedures which are
the compositions of from three to four @code{car} and @code{cdr}
operations.  For example @code{caddar} could be defined by

@example grammar
(define @deflikebind{caddar}
  (lambda (@letlikebind{x}) (car (cdr (cdr (car x))))))@r{.}
@end example

The procedures @code{car} and @code{cdr} themselves and the four
two-level compositions are included in the base library.  @xref{Pairs
and lists}.

